 "captions": [
  [
   0.0,
   1.348,
   "Part one. The harness."
  ],
  [
   1.98,
   4.676,
   "What surrounds the model, and why it matters"
  ],
  [
   4.676,
   6.361,
   "more than the model itself."
  ],
  [
   6.861,
   9.058,
   "Coding agents made one idea famous."
  ],
  [
   9.69,
   12.619,
   "The model is the engine. The harness is"
  ],
  [
   12.619,
   13.351,
   "the car."
  ],
  [
   13.982,
   16.911,
   "Small open projects, like Sebastian Raschka's mini coding"
  ],
  [
   16.911,
   19.84,
   "agent, show the same parts again and again."
  ],
  [
   20.472,
   23.401,
   "A context builder decides what the model sees."
  ],
  [
   24.032,
   25.497,
   "Tools are its hands."
  ],
  [
   26.128,
   29.057,
   "The loop runs model, then tools, then model"
  ],
  [
   29.057,
   29.423,
   "again."
  ],
  [
   30.055,
   32.618,
   "Memory carries things across turns and sessions."
  ],
  [
   33.249,
   35.812,
   "Guardrails set budgets and check the output."
  ],
  [
   36.444,
   39.373,
   "And traces plus evals tell you if a"
  ],
  [
   39.373,
   40.837,
   "change made things better."
  ],
  [
   41.469,
   44.398,
   "A data harness keeps this skeleton. We just"
  ],
  [
   44.398,
   46.594,
   "swap code tools for data tools."
  ],
  [
   47.094,
   49.777,
   "Here's the whole system on one sheet."
  ],
  [
   50.409,
   53.475,
   "On the left is the offline data plane."
  ],
  [
   53.475,
   56.541,
   "PDFs, Excel sheets, and SQL databases flow into"
  ],
  [
   56.541,
   59.607,
   "an ingest step, which parses, normalises, and validates."
  ],
  [
   60.239,
   63.305,
   "Out come three things. A facts table for"
  ],
  [
   63.305,
   66.371,
   "the numbers. A doc index for the text."
  ],
  [
   66.371,
   69.054,
   "And a catalog that records what exists."
  ],
  [
   69.686,
   72.752,
   "On the right is the online harness. A"
  ],
  [
   72.752,
   75.818,
   "semantic layer holds the metric formulas. Tools sit"
  ],
  [
   75.818,
   77.351,
   "on top of it."
  ],
  [
   77.983,
   81.049,
   "The agent loop calls those tools. Memory stores"
  ],
  [
   81.049,
   82.199,
   "what it learns."
  ],
  [
   82.831,
   85.897,
   "And a verifier checks every number before a"
  ],
  [
   85.897,
   87.43,
   "cited answer goes out."
  ],
  [
   87.93,
   91.103,
   "If you remember one design decision, make it"
  ],
  [
   91.103,
   91.896,
   "this one."
  ],
  [
   92.528,
   95.304,
   "Do the heavy lifting before the question."
  ],
  [
   95.935,
   99.108,
   "A two hundred page annual report should not"
  ],
  [
   99.108,
   102.281,
   "be parsed while a user waits. That's slow,"
  ],
  [
   102.281,
   104.264,
   "costly, and different every run."
  ],
  [
   104.896,
   108.069,
   "Instead, numbers become rows in a table. Prose"
  ],
  [
   108.069,
   109.259,
   "becomes searchable chunks."
  ],
  [
   109.89,
   113.063,
   "At question time, the agent queries clean data."
  ],
  [
   113.695,
   116.471,
   "Parse once. Validate once. Query many times."
  ]
